195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (He has worked with diverse clients, including Fortune 500 and FTSE 1OO companies such as Google, Nike, Spotify, Philips, startups, government agencies, and non-profits, helping them achieve their goals and overcome challenges. His extensive leadership experience has seen him lead teams across four continents, generating over $1 Billion in revenue. He is also dedicated to seeing more Black leaders in senior leadership positions and ensuring they do not have to navigate the corporate world alone like he had to.)
