<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (People are attracted to excellence because it seems like it can lead to a better career and personal recognition. But, why do so many talented folks face obstacles that stop them from moving up in their careers? This question sets the stage for looking closely at what people usually think about excellence.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
