229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As stagnation arises, individuals despite their efforts, find their career growth stalling and burnout emerges as a consequence of the relentless pursuit of unattainable standards, eroding both professional and personal well-being.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
