231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The paradox goes even further as people believe that working harder means they can control what happens. But, real office life involves things like favouritism, office politics, and factors that have nothing to do with how good you are at your job. This makes people feel let down, adding another layer to the complexity of the excellence paradox. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
