/S /P
/E (Personal Definition of Excellence: What does excellence mean to you in your work and life? Do you think about it in the usual work way, or does it include other things that make you feel successful and happy?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Pressure and Expectations: Can you remember a time when you felt a lot of pressure to do really well at work? Did this pressure come from your boss or the company, or did you put it on yourself? How did trying to meet these high standards affect how you felt mentally and physically?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
