259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (An ingrained belief or narrative within the corporate world that shapes expectations, influences behaviour, and contributes to the collective understanding of success. Corporate myths often arise from shared cultural values, passed down through generations of professionals, impacting perceptions of hard work, meritocracy, and the correlation between effort and success. These myths may not necessarily align with the complex realities of the corporate landscape, often requiring individuals to navigate beyond conventional wisdom for genuine achievement and sustainable growth.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
